# Raven's examples/headless/hello.script, which drives this port unchanged: hello names none of its
# widgets, so they are found by what they read.
#
#   bun run smoke
#
# (RAVEN_HEADLESS=1: no window on the screen; the exit code says whether it passed)

expect "text:Press the button" shown
click "text:Click me"
expect "text:Clicked 1 time" shown
click "text:Click me"
expect "text:Clicked 2 times" shown
mark clicked-twice
